{"id":14397,"mal_id":14397,"title":"Chihayafuru 2","englishTitle":null,"title_english":null,"alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["Chihayafull 2"],"en":"","ja":"ちはやふる 2"},"synopsis":"Chihaya Ayase is obsessed with developing her school's competitive karuta club, nursing daunting ambitions like winning the national team championship at the Omi Jingu and becoming the Queen, the best female karuta player in Japan—and in extension, the world. As their second year of high school rolls around, Chihaya and her fellow teammates must recruit new members, train their minds and bodies alike, and battle the formidable opponents that stand in their way to the championship title. Meanwhile, Chihaya's childhood friend, Arata Wataya, the prodigy who introduced her to karuta, rediscovers his lost love for the old card game.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"Chihaya Ayase está obsesionada con desarrollar el competitivo club de karuta de su escuela, albergando ambiciones desalentadoras como ganar el campeonato del equipo nacional en el Omi Jingu y convertirse en la Reina, la mejor jugadora de karuta de Japón y, en extensión, del mundo. A medida que avanza su segundo año de escuela secundaria, Chihaya y sus compañeros de equipo deben reclutar nuevos miembros, entrenar sus mentes y cuerpos por igual y luchar contra los formidables oponentes que se interponen en su camino hacia el título del campeonato. Mientras tanto, el amigo de la infancia de Chihaya, Arata Wataya, el prodigio que le presentó el karuta, redescubre su amor perdido por el viejo juego de cartas.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1340,"average_episode_duration":1340,"startDate":"2013-01-12","start_date":"2013-01-12","endDate":"2013-06-29","end_date":"2013-06-29","season":"winter","year":2013,"start_season":{"year":2013,"season":"winter"},"episodes":25,"num_episodes":25,"score":8.37,"mean":8.37,"numListUsers":255952,"num_list_users":